OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome
OL,6,Fpleasant evening sunshine to come and
OL,7,Fremaining dry and fine overnight with
OL,8,Flong clear spells. A few mist and fog
OL,9,Fpatches may form, with rural
OL,10,Ftemperatures dipping into single
OL,11,Ffigures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FAnother largely dry day,
OL,14,Falthough rather breezy, with sunny
OL,15,Fspells and some cloud. A risk of some
OL,16,Flight rain arriving into the far west
OL,17,Flater. Feeling slightly warmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
