OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FTurning unsettled midweek, with spells
OL,7,Fof rain and showers. Some heavy rain
OL,8,Fand thunderstorms are possible at
OL,9,Ftimes but also some drier and sunnier
OL,10,Fspells. Warmer and more humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
